The generated prompt's nominal output path `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Analytics/`
is NOT compiled by `apps/apple/project.yml` (the iOS/macOS app targets only source
`Sources/**` plus the specific `TeslaSync/<group>/` surface dirs — there is no
`TeslaSync/Features/` group). The five already-DONE sibling P7 pages
(admin/ApiPlayground, DiskForecast, FleetTelemetryCoverage, LiveSignalInspector,
SchemaDrift, TeslaOrders) all live under `apps/apple/Sources/Features/<Domain>/`.
