--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Architecture
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- `@Observable LifetimeStatsPageModel` (MainActor) owns the load state and the SI
  display-boundary converters; no networking in the view (ADR-004). Bound source is a
  `LifetimeStatsDataSource` seam (production → shared KMP analytics store; default →
  `SampleLifetimeStatsDataSource`).
- Lifetime stats are continuous-aggregate-derived (NOT live telemetry), so — like the
  sibling FleetTelemetryCoverage page — there is no SSE subscription / >2 min staleness
  indicator (ADR-013 applies only to live sources). No charts, no maps in this unit.
- Units: km/(km/h) → user unit via the shared SI engine `Units.convertDistance` /
  `Units.convertSpeed` at the render boundary only (Sources/SharedFacade/Units+Facade.swift
  → Shared.UnitsKt). The API/DB stay SI.
- Achievement gallery reuses the existing AchievementBadge unit's pure projection +
  tile (AchievementBadgeProjection.resolve + AchievementBadgeTile) — DRY, no clone.

